---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Avis CyberGhost 2026 - Test Complet, Prix et Fonctionnalités" description="Notre avis complet sur CyberGhost VPN : le plus simple à utiliser. Interface intuitive, streaming, prix.">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">

    <div class="mb-8">
      <a href="/comparatif/vpn" class="text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 text-sm">← Comparatif VPN</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-10">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <img src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=cyberghostvpn.com&sz=64" alt="CyberGhost" class="w-16 h-16 rounded-xl" />
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Avis <span class="gradient-text">CyberGhost</span> 2026</h1>
          <p class="text-gray-400">Le VPN le plus simple à utiliser</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Résumé rapide -->
    <div class="glass p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gold/30 mb-8">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg font-bold">⭐ 4.5/5</span>
          <span class="bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-sm">Ultra simple</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="line-through text-gray-500">12,99€/mois</span>
          <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-400">2,19€/mois</span>
          <span class="bg-red-500 text-white px-2 py-1 rounded-lg text-sm font-bold">-83%</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-300">
        CyberGhost est <span class="text-gold font-medium">le VPN idéal pour les débutants</span>. Interface ultra intuitive, serveurs optimisés par usage (streaming, gaming, torrent).
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Fiche technique -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">📋 Fiche technique</h2>
      <div class="glass rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-white/10">
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-400 w-1/3">Éditeur</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">CyberGhost S.R.L. (Roumanie)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-400">Serveurs</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">9 000+ serveurs dans 91 pays</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-400">Protocoles</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">WireGuard, OpenVPN, IKEv2</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-400">Appareils simultanés</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">7 appareils</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-400">Compatibilité</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Windows, Mac, iOS, Android, Linux, Smart TV, Consoles</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-400">Kill Switch</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-green-400 font-medium">✓ Oui</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-400">No-Log</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-green-400 font-medium">✓ Audité par Deloitte</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-400">Support</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Chat 24/7 + Email</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-400">Garantie</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-gold">45 jours satisfait ou remboursé</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Fonctionnalités clés -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">🚀 Fonctionnalités clés</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="glass p-4 rounded-xl">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="text-2xl">🎯</span>
            <h3 class="font-bold">Serveurs optimisés</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Serveurs dédiés Netflix, BBC, Torrent, Gaming. Un clic et c'est parti.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass p-4 rounded-xl">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="text-2xl">👶</span>
            <h3 class="font-bold">Interface simple</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">La plus intuitive du marché. Même votre grand-mère peut l'utiliser.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass p-4 rounded-xl">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="text-2xl">🛡️</span>
            <h3 class="font-bold">Bloqueur de pubs</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Bloque publicités et trackers automatiquement.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass p-4 rounded-xl">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="text-2xl">📱</span>
            <h3 class="font-bold">Apps dédiées</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Apps pour Fire TV, Android TV, consoles de jeux.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Streaming -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">📺 Streaming : ça débloque quoi ?</h2>
      <div class="glass rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead class="border-b border-white/10">
            <tr>
              <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left text-gray-400">Plateforme</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-gray-400">Fonctionne ?</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left text-gray-400">Serveur dédié ?</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-white/10">
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Netflix</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-green-400">✓</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-gold">Oui - US, UK, DE, FR</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Disney+</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-green-400">✓</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-gold">Oui</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Amazon Prime</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-green-400">✓</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-gold">Oui</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">BBC iPlayer</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-green-400">✓</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-gold">Oui</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Crunchyroll</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-green-400">✓</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-gold">Oui</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-3">💡 Les serveurs dédiés sont optimisés pour chaque plateforme.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Tarifs -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">💰 Tarifs</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="glass p-4 rounded-xl text-center">
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-1">1 mois</p>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold">12,99€</p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs">/mois</p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass p-4 rounded-xl text-center">
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-1">6 mois</p>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold">6,99€</p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs">/mois</p>
          <p class="text-green-400 text-xs mt-1">-46%</p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass p-4 rounded-xl text-center border border-gold/50 relative">
          <span class="absolute -top-2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-gold text-gray-900 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-bold">Meilleur choix</span>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-1">2 ans</p>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-gold">2,19€</p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs">/mois</p>
          <p class="text-green-400 text-xs mt-1">-83% + 2 mois offerts</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Avantages / Inconvénients -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">⚖️ Pour qui ?</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="glass p-6 rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-green-400 mb-4">✅ Idéal pour</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-green-400 mt-0.5">→</span>
              <span>Les débutants (interface ultra simple)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-green-400 mt-0.5">→</span>
              <span>Le streaming avec serveurs dédiés</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-green-400 mt-0.5">→</span>
              <span>Les gamers (serveurs optimisés jeux)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-green-400 mt-0.5">→</span>
              <span>Ceux qui veulent 45j de garantie</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="glass p-6 rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-red-400 mb-4">❌ Moins adapté si</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5">→</span>
              <span>Vous voulez des fonctions avancées</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5">→</span>
              <span>Vous êtes en Chine (ne fonctionne pas bien)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5">→</span>
              <span>Vous avez besoin d'appareils illimités</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Verdict -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">🏆 Notre verdict</h2>
      <div class="glass p-6 rounded-2xl border border-purple-500/30">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
          <span class="text-4xl">👍</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-bold text-lg">Parfait pour débuter</p>
            <p class="text-gray-400">Simple, efficace, pas cher</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">
          CyberGhost est <span class="text-white font-medium">le VPN qu'on recommande aux débutants</span>. Pas besoin de comprendre les protocoles ou les paramètres : tout est automatique.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-300">
          <span class="text-gold">Bonus :</span> 45 jours de garantie (vs 30 chez les autres), le temps de bien tester.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="glass p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gold/30 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-2">Offre exclusive</p>
      <p class="text-2xl font-bold mb-1">-83% + 2 mois offerts</p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mb-6">Soit <span class="text-gold font-bold">2,19€/mois</span> au lieu de 12,99€</p>
      <a href="https://cyberghostvpn.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-block bg-gold text-gray-900 px-10 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg hover:opacity-90 transition">
        Obtenir CyberGhost →
      </a>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-4">✓ Garantie 45 jours satisfait ou remboursé</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Alternatives -->
    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">🔄 Alternatives à considérer</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/avis/surfshark" class="glass p-4 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-4 hover:bg-white/5 transition">
          <img src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=surfshark.com&sz=32" alt="Surfshark" class="w-10 h-10 rounded" />
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium">Surfshark</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Appareils illimités • 2,29€/mois</p>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/avis/nordvpn" class="glass p-4 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-4 hover:bg-white/5 transition">
          <img src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=nordvpn.com&sz=32" alt="NordVPN" class="w-10 h-10 rounded" />
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium">NordVPN</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Le plus complet • 3,49€/mois</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </article>
</Layout>
